Corresponding source
====================

Core is source-only: it is consumed by project reference and vendored as source
by each product that links it. The complete corresponding source is

  - the vendored source at the pinned commit inside each product's source
    release (its `vendor/` directory), and
  - the source tarball and its SHA-256 attached to every Core release tag.

There is no package to download and no separate product page.

Vendored source
===============

The `bcs`/scripts project is vendored by source, not as a binary, under
GPL-3.0-or-later. Its complete source, licence and notices ship inside the
vendored tree. It is not linked into the Core libraries.

